  "problem": "What is the value of $h(t)=({t}^{3}-1)\\,i+{e}^{\\,t-1}\\,j+\\sqrt[4]{t+15}\\,sin\\,(\\frac{\\pi t}{2})\\,k$ at $t=1?$\n\n$h(1)=$\n{{field-1}} $i\\,+\\,$\n\n{{field-2}} $j\\,+\\,$\n\n{{field-3}} $k$",
